{"id":269,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"探究と国際理解を育てる半田高附属","feature_description":"中高6年間を通した教育理念のもと、知的好奇心、失敗から学ぶ姿勢、他者を思いやり挑戦する力を育てる学校です。課題研究を通じた探究学習や体験的な国際理解教育が示され、学校説明会や部活動見学の情報も整っていて、学校生活の全体像をつかみやすい構成です。学校説明会や部活動見学の情報も整い、入学後の活動像を具体的に想像しやすい構成です。","clubs":[],"profile_sources":[{"id":2770,"attribute_key":"feature_summary","source_url":"https://handa-jh.aichi-c.ed.jp/cms/info/page-1005.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-06","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null},{"id":2771,"attribute_key":"feature_description","source_url":"https://handa-jh.aichi-c.ed.jp/cms/info/page-1005.html","source_kind":"official_site","external_school_code":null,"verified_at":"2026-08-06","source_excerpt":null,"fetched_at":null,"content_hash":null,"invalidated_at":null,"priority":null}]}
